{"node_id": "real_062_batch_57_Volume18_Issue3-508.103023_8_HY_004", "node_type": "evidence", "status": "HYBRID_SHADOW_CANDIDATE", "unit_type": "TEXT", "source_atom_ids": ["D0007"], "source_fragment_ids": ["D0007_F001"], "source_visual_bundle_ids": [], "plain_text": "Those with endometriosis may have some or many\nof these symptoms. Because endometriosis can be\ndifficult to diagnose, be sure to discuss all of your\nsymptoms with your health care provider to make\nsure you are diagnosed correctly.", "semantic_text": "Those with endometriosis may have some or many of these symptoms. Because endometriosis can be difficult to diagnose, be sure to discuss all of your symptoms with your health care provider to make sure you are diagnosed correctly.", "visual_description": null, "geometry_members": [{"member_id": "D0007_geometry", "bbox": [87, 680, 523, 830], "bbox_source": "dolphin_v2_resized_image_pixels", "source_atom_id": "D0007"}], "native_visual_components": [], "production_modified": false, "visual_description_status": "UNVERIFIED_RETRIEVAL_HINT", "node_policy": "bounded-v2", "scoring_mode": "embedding_geometry", "hybrid_model_decision_file": "/hkfs/home/project/hk-project-p0025545/dv3352/Project/remote_runs/node-first-realpdf-20261118/output/nodes_prepared_incremental_non_nasa_after_all_parse_20261119/batch_38/hybrid/real_062_batch_57_Volume18_Issue3-508.103023/page_0008/decisions.json"}
{"node_id": "real_062_batch_57_Volume18_Issue3-508.103023_8_HY_005", "node_type": "evidence", "status": "HYBRID_SHADOW_CANDIDATE", "unit_type": "TEXT", "source_atom_ids": ["D0009"], "source_fragment_ids": ["D0009_F001"], "source_visual_bundle_ids": [], "plain_text": "First, a health care provider will take a full medical\nhistory and give a complete physical and medical exam.\nThey will do this before performing a surgery, which is\nthe only way to diagnose endometriosis.", "semantic_text": "First, a health care provider will take a full medical history and give a complete physical and medical exam. They will do this before performing a surgery, which is the only way to diagnose endometriosis.", "visual_description": null, "geometry_members": [{"member_id": "D0009_geometry", "bbox": [87, 885, 563, 1002], "bbox_source": "dolphin_v2_resized_image_pixels", "source_atom_id": "D0009"}], "native_visual_components": [], "production_modified": false, "visual_description_status": "UNVERIFIED_RETRIEVAL_HINT", "node_policy": "bounded-v2", "scoring_mode": "embedding_geometry", "hybrid_model_decision_file": "/hkfs/home/project/hk-project-p0025545/dv3352/Project/remote_runs/node-first-realpdf-20261118/output/nodes_prepared_incremental_non_nasa_after_all_parse_20261119/batch_38/hybrid/real_062_batch_57_Volume18_Issue3-508.103023/page_0008/decisions.json"}
{"node_id": "real_062_batch_57_Volume18_Issue3-508.103023_8_HY_006", "node_type": "evidence", "status": "HYBRID_SHADOW_CANDIDATE", "unit_type": "TEXT", "source_atom_ids": ["D0010"], "source_fragment_ids": ["D0010_F001"], "source_visual_bundle_ids": [], "plain_text": "The most common type of surgery to diagnose\nendometriosis is called a laparoscopy. In this surgery, a\nsurgeon uses a tiny camera attached to a thin tube (called\na laparoscope) to see inside the uterus, fallopian tubes,\novaries, and bladder and around the intestines. Sometimes\na small sample of tissue, called a biopsy, is taken during\nsurgery to confirm the diagnosis.", "semantic_text": "The most common type of surgery to diagnose endometriosis is called a laparoscopy. In this surgery, a surgeon uses a tiny camera attached to a thin tube (called a laparoscope) to see inside the uterus, fallopian tubes, ovaries, and bladder and around the intestines. Sometimes a small sample of tissue, called a biopsy, is taken during surgery to confirm the diagnosis.", "visual_description": null, "geometry_members": [{"member_id": "D0010_geometry", "bbox": [87, 1006, 587, 1215], "bbox_source": "dolphin_v2_resized_image_pixels", "source_atom_id": "D0010"}], "native_visual_components": [], "production_modified": false, "visual_description_status": "UNVERIFIED_RETRIEVAL_HINT", "node_policy": "bounded-v2", "scoring_mode": "embedding_geometry", "hybrid_model_decision_file": "/hkfs/home/project/hk-project-p0025545/dv3352/Project/remote_runs/node-first-realpdf-20261118/output/nodes_prepared_incremental_non_nasa_after_all_parse_20261119/batch_38/hybrid/real_062_batch_57_Volume18_Issue3-508.103023/page_0008/decisions.json"}
